INFO9 Welcome to my Gran Turismo-inspired showroom!
INFO10 This project had been in plans and worked on for the past 3 years. I hope you enjoyed all the hard work I've poured into making this!
INFO11 All the available controls are displayed in the footer at the bottom of the screen, please check it out if you're confused on which button does what.
INFO12 You can highlight a setting to view its description in the footer, this applies to all the setting boxes!
